/-!
# Stage P2 Over-Path Top-Level Specification

Proves `stageP2_over_v1_kits_ext` and `stageP2_over_v1_kits`, verifying Over-path Stage P2
(`+0x0868 → +0x1778` archiving `sess` into `previous_sessions` via `SessionRecord::promote_state`
and initializing Bob's SPQR-V1 session at `coroPtr + 0xf8`, plus all 6 store-error and
PQXDH-rejection exits to `s0.readReg64 .x30`).
-/

public section

set_option autoImplicit false

attribute [-arm64_norm]
